# The Abyss's acid vent pool (content 11-04): CIPlay the_abyss_acid, in a test world 'CI ...'. The pool lies on a
# low shelf on the lagoon side of the lava tube's path (recipe 79.5 13). Without the suit (CIGapsSuit off) the acid
# burns: expect hurt checks the health it took (11-05: a run with 0 damage passed - a health watch run before the play
# had ended when it began). The suit run is the_abyss_acidsuit.
island The Abyss keep
offset -2.8577 -0.3744
hour 11
weather Calm
at 79.5 13
wait 5
expect message The vent water burns.
at 79.5 13
wait 4
# (5 a second for ~9 s: at least 20)
expect hurt 20
# the way out: from the pool's middle up the shallow slope on the path's side, onto the path
walk 79.5 13 to 81.8 11.4 to 84.6 9.4 to 87 9 h=3
